			"interpretation": "features/commonbusiness is a HarmonyOS HAR: src/main/module.json5 declares module type 'har' named 'commonbusiness'; oh-package.json5 names the package @ohos/commonbusiness with main Index.ets. Responsibility: a reusable home-page UI foundation - BaseHomeView switches on LoadingStatus (SUCCESS/FAILED/LOADING/NO_NETWORK); BaseHomeViewModel.sendEvent dispatches BaseHomeEventType events to handlers for adaptive banner height per breakpoint, spring-back and title-bar animations, NavPathStack navigation to Article/Sample/Component detail pages, and double-back-press exit with a toast; BannerSource implements IDataSource. Boundary: the public surface is exactly the re-exports of Index.ets; the only intra-repo dependency is file:../../common (@ohos/common), plus @kit imports; root build-profile.json5 registers the module. Relations: coupling flows through shared AppStorage keys (GLOBAL_INFO, HOME_PAGE_CONTEXT, IS_SIDEBAR_LAYOUT) and HdsTabsController, not only through exported symbols. Maintenance contract: preserve the Index.ets export list, the AppStorage key conventions, and the ../../common dependency; tests present are scaffold-only.",
			"kind": "analysis",
			"limitations": ["Whether any product or sibling feature module actually consumes @ohos/commonbusiness could not be verified: the checkout is sparse-checked to features/commonbusiness, so products/ and other feature trees are absent from the working directory and only root build-profile.json5 registration was observed.","The behavioral account of AppStorage keys (GLOBAL_INFO, HOME_PAGE_CONTEXT, IS_SIDEBAR_LAYOUT, CURRENT_TAB) rests on imports and usage sites only; the StorageKey and GlobalInfoModel definitions live in @ohos/common under common/, which is not in the working tree, so their semantics are unproved.","No build, test, or runtime execution was performed: hvigor HAR packaging, obfuscation/consumer rule handling, and the hypium ohosTest/localUnit suites were never run, so compile-correctness and test pass status remain unproved.","The claimed navigation targets (PageEnum.COMPONENT_DETAIL_VIEW, SAMPLE_DETAIL_VIEW, BANNER_DETAIL_VIEW) are defined in @ohos/common outside this scope; that the pushed routes are actually registered by some consumer page is unproved."],
